[?2004lge_id":[?2004h>     "18078efe9380c8dc": {
[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Important warnings and precautions associated with lopinavir and ritonavir include: 1) Risk of serious adverse reactions due to drug interactions (as a CYP3A inhibitor); 2) Toxicity in preterm neonates due to ethanol and propylene glycol content; 3) Pancreatitis (sometimes fatal); 4) Hepatotoxicity and hepatic decompensation; 5) QT interval prolongation and torsade de pointes; 6) PR interval prolongation and second or third degree atrioventricular block; 7) New onset or exacerbation of diabetes mellitus and hyperglycemia; 8) Immune reconstitution syndrome; 9) Lipid elevations (total cholesterol and triglycerides); 10) Fat redistribution/accumulation; 11) Increased bleeding in patients with hemophilia; and 12) Potential for development of resistance and cross-resistance.",
