[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Important warnings and precautions associated with Paxlovid include: 1) Risk of serious, life-threatening, or fatal adverse reactions due to drug interactions, as ritonavir is a strong CYP3A inhibitor; 2) Hypersensitivity reactions, including anaphylaxis, toxic epidermal necrolysis (TEN), and Stevens-Johnson syndrome; 3) Hepatotoxicity, including transaminase elevations, clinical hepatitis, and pancreatitis; and 4) Risk of HIV-1 resistance development in patients with uncontrolled or undiagnosed HIV-1 infection, due to the ritonavir component.",
[?2004l[?2004h>         "citations": [
